## CommunityToolkit.Maui.MediaElement integration

The app uses a project reference to a local copy/fork:
- `libraries/CommunityToolkit.Maui.MediaElement/`

`MauiProgram` enables it with:
- `.UseMauiCommunityToolkitMediaElement()`

Platform notes (library-level, high-level):
- Android uses ExoPlayer under the hood (via toolkit implementation)
- iOS uses AVPlayer

