## Android Auto (two implementations)

Bible Alarm supports both:
- **Modern “Car App”** (AndroidX Car App Library)
  - `src/Bible.Alarm/Platforms/Android/Services/AndroidAuto/CarAppService.cs`
- **Legacy MediaBrowserServiceCompat** (phone projection older stacks)
  - `src/Bible.Alarm/Platforms/Android/Services/AndroidAuto/LegacyMediaBrowserService.cs`

Both rely on:
- the shared `MediaSessionCompat`
- schedule data sourced from Fluxor state (helpers live in `AndroidAutoScheduleHelper.cs`)

